<title>USA: MS Financial CEO Philip Hubbuch resigns.</title>
<headline>MS Financial CEO Philip Hubbuch resigns.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>MS Financial Inc said Thursday its vice chairman and chief executive officer, Philip Hubbuch Jr., has resigned to pursue other business interests.</p>
<p>MS Financial is a specialized consumer finance company that purchases and services retail installment contracts on new and used cars and light duty trucks.  The company serves more than 800 dealerships in 13 states.</p>
<p>The company recently announced it was to be acquired by Search Capital Group Inc in a stock deal valued at $21 million.</p>
